This package depends on, and does not vendor or redistribute:

- JAXTPC (https://github.com/DeepLearnPhysics/JAXTPC): no licence file at the pinned commit; used only from a
  checkout the user installs. dunefastsim.steps.schema describes JAXTPC's input file layout; no JAXTPC code is copied.
- lumen and lumen-tpc (https://github.com/OmarAlterkait/lumen, .../lumen-tpc), Apache-2.0.
- bdnmc-dune (https://github.com/RobMina/bdnmc-dune), MIT.
- edep-sim (https://github.com/lbl-neutrino/edep-sim): its ROOT output is read; no code is copied.

DUNE geometry files (GDML) are not part of this repository; they are fetched from DUNE's public ND_Production
repository at a fixed commit.
